    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are pleased to present 35 Orwell Woods to the market. A wonderful opportunity to acquire a deceptively spacious semi-detached modern bungalow. Tucked away in a quiet a cul-de-sac in this small development of bungalows and townhouses off Orwell Park overlooking communal green to front with parking for two cars, side access and low maintenance rear garden.\r\n\r\nCarefully maintained by its current owner with excellent layout, full of natural light and tastefully presented throughout. \r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises of entrance lobby, lounge/ dining to the front with bay window and open fire with marble surround. The kitchen has a range of overhead and undercounter shaker units and door to side. Bathroom with bath, w.c and whb with store and hotpress. The first of two double bedrooms is to the side with wardrobes and door to side. The principle bedroom is to the rear of the property with door and window overlooking rear garden, built in wardrobes and ensuite showerroom off. \r\n\r\nOutside is parking and lawn to front, side access and paved garden to rear bordered by shrubs and planting. \r\n\r\nOrwell Woods has an enviable location with an array of local shopping facilities on Rathmines Road Upper and  Rathgar village. With easy access to the villages of Rathmines and Ranelagh with their wide selection of shops, restaurants, cinemas, bars etc. Amenities in the area are in abundance with Palmerston Park, Milltown Golf Club and Dodder Linear Park on your doorstep.  \r\n\r\nThe location is within walking distance to the LUAS and a number of bus routes linking into the city centre and further afield."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Lobby\r\nGlazed door to \r\n\r\nLiving /Dining \r\nFloor to ceiling windows to front and side. Open fire with marble surround and recessed lights\r\n\r\nKitchen/ Breakfast room  \r\nExtensive range of overhead and undercounter fitted units, stainless steel sink, plumed for dishwasher, tiled floor and splashback and recessed lights. \r\n\r\nLiving \r\nSpacious living with gas fire, marble fireplace and surround, bay window with picture windows and door to rear garden. \r\n\r\nInner hallway \r\nHot press, storage and access to attic. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (Rear) Ensuite \r\nFitted wardrobes, door and window overlooking garden. \r\nEnsuite \r\nShower, w.c, whb, towel radiator, vanity mirror and light. Tiled floor and part tiled walls. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (Rear)\r\nBuilt in wardrobe and door to side. \r\n\r\nBathroom\r\nBath with shower attachment, w.c, whb, shavers socket, part tiled walls. \r\n\r\nOutside \r\nLow maintenance paved garden to the front with raised bedding with shrubs and planting. Private gardens to the rear laid out in paved patio area bordered by a variety of shrubs and planting throughout."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Secluded low maintenance gardens. \r\nMaintenance Fee c. €640\r\nSmall development. \r\nParking for two cars.\r\nOverlooking communal green. \r\nCul de sac location. \r\nGenerously proportioned. \r\nGFCH. \r\nGreat transport links in the area including LUAS.\r\nLocated beside Dodder Linear Park and Palmerston Park.\r\nWithin easy reach of the villages of Rathgar, Rathmines and Ranelagh\r\nEasy access to M50 and city centre."
      },
      {
